  "rootAssessment": "Lead assent for J3a after Codex ACCEPT-UNIT on r2 (review codex-j3a-r2; RF-J3A-1 closed). J3a carries RequestIdentity, ExecutionIdReservations, the durable entry, and CommitSession::open's reservation. ReservedExecutionId is constructed only after a successful registry insert; there is no inherent constructor. Inventory v139, parent v138, adds the sixteen refusal-suite rows. No contract successor. Product code is 9859ce5, which keeps HSR-1. Both X9 lead sets passed on that clean commit (storage 403 PASS, host 98 PASS) before this bind.",
